---
id: classify
harpoon: "1.0"
name: Classifier
model: anthropic/claude-sonnet-4-20250514
entrypoint: true
input:
  message:
    type: string
    description: Message to classify
    required: true
output:
  format: json
  schema:
    intent:
      type: string
      description: The classified intent
    confidence:
      type: number
      description: Confidence score
next: prompts/respond.prompt
---
Classify the intent of: {{message}}
